# Claim the Kingdom's "sacrifice it. When you do, put an indestructible counter on target creature you control": with its
# fourth-plan-counter trigger on the stack on turn 5, Bot2 kills Bot1's only creature, the Ornithopter (four +1/+1 counters
# on a 0/2, so a 4/6), with two Lightning Bolts. The trigger then resolves: the
# enchantment is sacrificed, and the reflexive ability (CR 603.12) has no creature to target, so it is removed from the
# stack (CR 603.3d) and no indestructible counter is put anywhere.

